ainer_38-H0"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-container-overlay_1nuZ1" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopover" id="review-media-popover-content-R18SJLZI8KECTY"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-content-wrapper_3MziH"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-background-wrapper_2UMSb"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-topbar_knKqX"><button data-popover-id="R18SJLZI8KECTY" class="_Y3Itd_close-button_2RG2d" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButton" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButtonClickHandler" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-id="32xpda-lgyfl7-wes1ve-2o46rw"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R18SJLZI8KECTY" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-asin="B0B6CV93TY" data-mobile="false" data-locale="de-DE" data-localelanguagename="Deutsch" data-sourcelanguage="de-DE" data-sourcelanguagename="Deutsch" data-iscustomerrecognized="false" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="A1PA6795UKMFR9"><div id="R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="n6292y-4prw75-nsa8f5-2k2xjc"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFA34K7OICTD7PBXEK5WNIGW4MLQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2N60XNHAJXR0N_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="alikls-d1bw2g-goqjh7-z5n095"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">J.M</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 von 5&nbsp;Sternen</span></i></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2N60XNHAJXR0N/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="de-DE">Eine Buchreihe fürs Leben ♥️</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Bewertet in Deutschland am 24. April 2023</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-4"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-4-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-4-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-4-card0" data-csa-c-id="keaxzn-i2h6sb-mmj215-q5108e"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="de-DE" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Bei dieser Geschichte geht es mir einfach immer gleich: Kaum am Ende angekommen, wünsche ich mich direkt wieder an den Anfang zurück. 😌</span></p><p><span>Die besten Bücher sind die, die man immer wieder lesen möchte ♥️</span></p><p></p><p><span>Die Welt, die Tolkien geschaffen hat ist in jedem Fall einzigartig.</span></p><p><span>Detaillierte Beschreibungen machen es stets leicht, sich Umgebung und Situationen vorzustellen.</span></p><p></p><p><span>Auch in „Die Rückkehr des Königs“ wurden Szenenwechsel wieder sehr gut und an den richtigen Stellen platziert, sodass man beim Lesen nicht den Überblick verliert und die Geschichte in genau dem richtigen Maß spannend bleibt.</span></p><p></p><p><span>Im letzten Teil der Trilogie fallen meiner Meinung nach die größten Unterschiede zwischen Büchern und Filmen auf, was es umso lohnenswerter macht die Geschichte nicht nur zu kucken, sondern auch zu lesen.</span></p><p><span>Ich kann es jedem nur ans Herz legen. ♥️</span></p><p><span>Man kann hier auf jeden Fall noch so einige Male überrascht werden, mehr verrate ich dazu nicht. 🤭</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="ynwxwm-anlmz4-plo60y-ysl546"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text">Mehr erfahren</span><span class="a-see-less-text">Weniger anzeigen</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small"><div class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile-section_15c2C"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-physicalid="71Cv9dSIyUL"><img alt="Eine Buchreihe fürs Leben ♥️" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cv9dSIyUL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><div id="mediaModal_R2N60XNHAJXR0N"><div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-cr-top-reviews-media-modal_R2N60XNHAJXR0N"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-media-popover-container_FDNFG" data-hook="media-popover-container"><div class="_Y3Itd_modal-content-container_1p_Aj" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-reviewbind="SingleReviewMediaBlock" data-reviewid="R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover" data-closebuttonaria="" data-modaltitlearia="" data-hook="modal-content-container" data-csa-c-id="qxswku-n4ssn1-sic1xg-3vumph"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-body-container_3kalb"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-container_39x8v"><button class="_Y3Itd_left-icon-container_1saao" data-mix-operations="leftClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/sash//23pID5Mp1WTA-31.svg"></span></button><div data-reviewbind="MainMedia" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-modal-media-list-view-container_1uARM"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_1XEVZ" data-mediaid="71Cv9dSIyUL" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cv9dSIyUL.jpg" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover_71Cv9dSIyUL_0" data-csa-c-id="kkxpqn-kxduj9-r10sor-sgrik9"><img alt="Eine Buchreihe fürs Leben ♥️" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cv9dSIyUL._SY500_.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_1J8fN"></div></div><button class="_Y3Itd_right-icon-container_2ryP4" data-mix-operations="rightClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/sash//7D8iRtQ0DrKAF4O.svg"></span></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-review-container_1w2Ex"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-container_2rHXZ"><div class="a-section a-spacing-small _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-header-section_KhwYb"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFA34K7OICTD7PBXEK5WNIGW4MLQ" data-csa-c-slot-id="profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="7l1c15-q4n96f-utkgvs-61r1rw"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png" class="" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">J.M</span></div></a></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 von 5&nbsp;Sternen</span></i></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2N60XNHAJXR0N/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="de-DE">Eine Buchreihe fürs Leben ♥️</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Bewertet in Deutschland am 24. April 2023</span></div></div><p><span>Bei dieser Geschichte geht es mir einfach immer gleich: Kaum am Ende angekommen, wünsche ich mich direkt wieder an den Anfang zurück. 😌</span></p><p><span>Die besten Bücher sind die, die man immer wieder lesen möchte ♥️</span></p><p></p><p><span>Die Welt, die Tolkien geschaffen hat ist in jedem Fall einzigartig.</span></p><p><span>Detaillierte Beschreibungen machen es stets leicht, sich Umgebung und Situationen vorzustellen.</span></p><p></p><p><span>Auch in „Die Rückkehr des Königs“ wurden Szenenwechsel wieder sehr gut und an den richtigen Stellen platziert, sodass man beim Lesen nicht den Überblick verliert und die Geschichte in genau dem richtigen Maß spannend bleibt.</span></p><p></p><p><span>Im letzten Teil der Trilogie fallen meiner Meinung nach die größten Unterschiede zwischen Büchern und Filmen auf, was es umso lohnenswerter macht die Geschichte nicht nur zu kucken, sondern auch zu lesen.</span></p><p><span>Ich kann es jedem nur ans Herz legen. ♥️</span></p><p><span>Man kann hier auf jeden Fall noch so einige Male überrascht werden, mehr verrate ich dazu nicht. 🤭</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="71Cv9dSIyUL" data-reviewid="R2N60XNHAJXR0N" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cv9dSIyUL.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Eine Person fand diese Informationen hilfreich</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-sec